ui-the-expanded-and-collapsed-states-use-the-same-elevation-only-the-width-and-label-opacity = The expanded and collapsed states use the same elevation. Only the width and label opacity animate when the label expands or collapses.

ui-height-icon-size-and-padding-scale-with-the-size-variant-reserve-16dp-margins-around-a-flo = Height, icon size, and padding scale with the size variant. Reserve 16dp margins around a floating action, and keep at least 80dp of width available for the label when the action is expanded.

