ui-extended-fabs-should-have-margins-of-16dp = Extended FABs should have margins of 16dp.

ui-choose-the-size-by-window-class-the-small-extended-fab-suits-compact-and-medium-layouts-wh = Choose the size by window class. The small extended FAB suits compact and medium layouts, while the medium and large sizes give the action more presence in expanded layouts.

ui-compact = Compact

ui-expanded = Expanded

ui-the-same-label-at-two-size-presets-the-large-size-carries-more-weight-in-wide-layouts = The same label at two size presets; the large size carries more weight in wide layouts.

ui-an-extended-fab-can-collapse-to-an-icon-only-container-while-content-scrolls-then-expand-a = An extended FAB can collapse to an icon-only container while content scrolls, then expand again when people stop or scroll back. Keep the action reachable in both states and never hide it behind scrolling content.

ui-when-the-label-collapses-keep-the-accessible-name-unchanged-so-assistive-technology-still = When the label collapses, keep the accessible name unchanged so assistive technology still announces the action. The container keeps its tone and elevation across the transition.

