ui-identify-the-action-from-its-label-and-icon = Identify the action from its label and icon

ui-the-extended-fab-exposes-one-action-named-by-its-label-activating-it-increments-the-counte = The extended FAB exposes one action named by its label; activating it increments the counter.

ui-extended-fabs-are-large-targets-by-construction-the-smallest-container-is-56dp-high-and-th = Extended FABs are large targets by construction: the smallest container is 56dp high and the interactive target never drops below 48 × 48dp. Keep the label and icon contrast at 3:1 or higher against the container.

