ui-above-3-1-on-primary-container-versus-a-low-contrast-pairing = Above 3:1 on primary container versus a low-contrast pairing.

ui-the-pressed-and-focused-state-layers-use-the-content-color-so-a-custom-container-keeps-rea = The pressed and focused state layers use the content color, so a custom container keeps readable feedback only when its on-color is chosen deliberately.

ui-initial-focus-should-land-on-the-extended-fab-when-it-is-the-only-floating-action-on-the-s = Initial focus should land on the extended FAB when it is the only floating action on the screen, and otherwise follow the reading order of the page. The container itself is a single focus stop; its icon and label are not separate targets.

ui-press-tab-to-reach-the-action-the-whole-container-receives-focus-once = Press Tab to reach the action; the whole container receives focus once.

ui-navigate-to-the-extended-fab = Navigate to the extended FAB

ui-activate-the-extended-fab = Activate the extended FAB

ui-the-extended-fab-behaves-like-a-button-for-keyboard-input-a-single-focus-stop-activated-by = The extended FAB behaves like a button for keyboard input: a single focus stop, activated by Space or Enter. Focus is drawn as a ring around the container, not around the icon or label.

ui-the-accessible-name-of-an-extended-fab-is-its-visible-label-so-the-icon-must-not-repeat-it = The accessible name of an extended FAB is its visible label, so the icon must not repeat it. Do not label the icon: it is decorative whenever the text already names the action.

ui-do-one-label-one-announcement-compose-button = Do: one label, one announcement — “Compose, button”.

ui-don-t-compose-edit-pencil-icon-button-the-icon-description-duplicates-the-action = Don't: “Compose, edit pencil icon, button” — the icon description duplicates the action.

ui-when-the-label-collapses-keep-the-same-accessible-name-provide-a-visible-label-on-request = When the label collapses, keep the same accessible name. Provide a visible label on request rather than replacing the name with an icon description.

